  "_commit": {
    "id": "a05551948a56776664fc9ef861996e52f452b3fd",
    "author": "qhu <huqmail@gmail.com>",
    "committer": "qhu <huqmail@gmail.com>",
    "message": "Upgrade to MACS 3.1.0, add threads argument, version bump 1.21.4\n\n- Use Python 3.12 and macs3 3.1.0 in the basilisk environment.\n- hmmratac: add remove_dup and em_jump, deprecate keepduplicates,\n  and default decoding_steps to 5000 as in MACS 3.1.0.\n- Add threads (default 1) to callpeak, predictd, pileup, filterdup,\n  randsample, refinepeak, hmmratac and callvar. callvar: deprecate np.\n- pileup: detect the input format in R when format = \"AUTO\", since\n  MACS3 pileup rejects AUTO. Add a test for it.\n- Add inst/CITATION for the MACS3 paper.\n",
    "time": 1792599500
  },
